     1305                                             , input p-qnty as decimal
     1306                                             , input p-cli-base-rate as decimal
     1307                                             , input p-dis-kat as integer
     1308                                             , input-output p-price as decimal
     1309                                             , output p-discnt-pcnt as decimal
     1310                                             , output p-discnt-sum as decimal
